    Optional baseline code:
      - StateMask original: github.com/nuwuxian/RL-state_mask
      - JSRL: github.com/steventango/jumpstart-rl

    Hardware:
      - Training: 8× NVIDIA A100 (as used in paper) or equivalent; experiments are
        feasible on fewer GPUs with longer wall time.
      - Minimum: one GPU with 12 GB VRAM for MuJoCo mask/refine experiments.

    Installation order:
      1. Install PyTorch + CUDA.
      2. Install Stable-Baselines3 and Gymnasium.
      3. Install MuJoCo bindings.
      4. Clone and install each real-world task repository in a separate conda env
